- [done] Added live XMPP roster-push handling and auto-mapped joined/seen MUC rooms into `XMPP Spaces`.
- [done] Added bookmarks sync fallback chain: XEP-0402 pubsub (`urn:xmpp:bookmarks:1`) then legacy private XML (`storage:bookmarks`).
- [done] Added XMPP keepalive ping support (XEP-0199): answer incoming ping IQ and send periodic session pings.
- [done] Added XMPP last-message-correction sync (XEP-0308): apply incoming `replace` stanzas and publish correction stanzas for local edits when reference IDs are available.
- [done] Hardened sed-style inline correction (`s/old/new/`) to prefer latest editable text messages, reject malformed sed syntax early, and support explicit nth-match substitutions (`s/old/new/2`).
- [done] Fixed `/shrug` rendering to preserve the expected `¯\_(ツ)_/¯` output with inline markdown parsing enabled.
- [done] Added `Add Friend` DM modal (username/JID) and direct XMPP one-to-one DM stanza send/receive path.
